{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act40side_level_act40side_08_end",
  "groupId": "act40side",
  "stageId": "act40side_08",
  "title": "金玉藏心",
  "storyCode": "OR-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0a4f73d25506419be51d393ff249c62741db5431528e06ed2197da0b3204e1b1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g9_dalitemple"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虞澄……你想要的，當年太師案的真相，就是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還有什麼想問的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說了這麼多，寧大人倒是隻字不提，自己在這一系列事件中的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你為什麼要派人刺殺刑部尚書？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虞少卿不是已經有答案了嗎？許多年前，你不是指控我在亂局中為求自保，便派人謀害了查案的刑部尚書嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寧大人倒不必急著這樣抹黑自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實這個問題也困擾了我很久，顧筌時隔十幾年再回到百灶，為何偏偏留在你的家中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到那一次，我在你家看到那個女孩，我的最後一個問題才得到解答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "顧筌九死一生，還是要回到百灶，不只是為了查明當年真相，也是為了找到，自己遺落在百灶的女兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來顧筌告訴你的事，似乎也沒有那麼多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，剩下的事，都只是我的猜想，要是有不對的地方，寧大人大可笑話我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說，當年太師背負謀逆之罪自盡後，舉國譁然，文武百官紛紛表態與太師割席。可是有一個學宮的學生，竟敢當眾上門憑弔太師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也因此，他撞見了太師被抄家的場面。慌亂中，他只得帶走了太師家中一個出生不久的女嬰——巧的是，他自己的女兒也剛剛出世。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不知所措，帶著妻子和兩個嬰兒想要逃離百灶，可他不過是一個勢單力薄的書生，沒過多久，就被趕來的禁軍抓到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概是那位禁軍心存恻隱，也是有意為太師保留血脈，放了那書生一條生路，帶回了那個書生的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知顧筌該作何想，不過當時的他大概也別無選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個孩子落在刑部尚書手中，她的血脈一查便知，可如何處理這個本是局外人的孩子，反而成了懸而未決的難題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在這個時候，對於刑部尚書過激之舉早有不滿的寧大人，終於選擇鋌而走險，派人刺殺了刑部尚書。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太師案牽連甚廣，手上沾滿了血的刑部尚書遭人報復，似乎也在情理之中，時局既定，真龍便默許這一系列風波以這種方式落下帷幕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那最後沒有解決的問題，也只剩下了那個孩子。從結果來看，她既然被寧大人收養，其中過程，似乎也不難猜。但要說目的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寧大人，我沒記錯的話，你也在太師門下讀過書，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……虞澄啊虞澄，你要是不在大理寺為官，你要是不在這獄中，我真不敢想，你這樣的心計，還能做出什麼事來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可怕，真可怕……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寧大人過獎了，和顧筌比起來，我不過是個笨人。只是當這大理寺少卿，見過太多人了——見多了，也就懂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在想起來，顧筌在百珍宴上為真龍獻上那道菜，近乎求死之舉，實際上是已經與真相和解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而他在臨死前，沒有告訴我真相，卻向我透露了太師遺孤的下落——他是希望我查明真相後，也能選擇和解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……可我和解不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只能用這種方式，找到那些留下的人、你在乎的人，逼你把真相吐出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寧大人，細算來，你不能算是個壞人，或許只能算是懦弱……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你大可恨我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再見到那個孩子一面，也算了了我一樁心願。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會去見陛下……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g1_yusrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……都知道了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在剛剛……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還想問你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼……還能這麼冷靜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一個在心裡藏了很多年的猜想……終於被證實了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像紮在手心裡的一根刺，拔掉了，流了血，也就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼……不說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道……怎麼會是這樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我該難過嗎？還是該生氣……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道……我只是覺得腦子一團糟，心裡堵得難受……我不知道這一肚子火到底該向誰發洩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，是不是該我反過來問你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌……你能不能告訴我，顧筌……我的父親他，是個什麼樣的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他……他就是一個笨蛋、書呆子、說謊精！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我討厭說謊！我見過太多謊言，利欲薰心的謊言、懦弱的謊言、狡詐的謊言……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我真的沒見過……有人用一輩子去撒一個謊，還把自己的親女兒弄丟了，把自己也弄丟了，就為了保護一個毫不相干的人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他怎麼……能這麼笨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想起，以前在書上看過的一個故事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從前有一個衛兵，守著江邊的一所驛站。有一天，他注意到上游發了洪水，想要跑到上游，去提醒那裡的人關閉水閘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是他跑到一半，發現江水漲得太急，想要關閘已經來不及了，便想立刻趕回下游的村莊，讓那裡的人趕快疏散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個人就這樣來回跑著，直到最後他也葬身在這場洪水裡，他什麼都沒能做到，誰也沒有救下……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又說這些繞來繞去的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說……這個人做的事，聽起來是不是很熟悉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白！雖然我搞不懂你說的繞來繞去的例子，但你在說他的壞話對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不是個壞人！他只是……唉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，你當然有理由怨他，可是如果是他主動拋下了你，他又怎麼會花這麼多時間回來找你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼反而安慰起我來了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌……你是感染者，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你什麼時候知道——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這個人——是人精吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我沒有什麼別的意思……我只是在想，這其實本應該是我的命運……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在胡說八道什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你做錯了什麼事？有什麼厄運需要你承擔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我現在活得沒什麼不好的，有許多夥伴，找到了自己的理想……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，明明你過得很慘吧！一個人生活在深宅大院裡，孤零零地長大就開心了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎麼覺得，你像是在罵我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白……我明白的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對啦……我還沒有問過，你到底叫什麼名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "燭煌……顧燭煌，我爸——是他為我取的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈……我都忘了有多久沒和別人說過，我原來叫這個名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，這下我真的沒有秘密了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“螢燭燭之煌，微明可顧”……真像是他會取的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌……是不是到現在，我才算真正認識了你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算……算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對，我還有好多事沒跟你講，我還要帶你去維多利亞看看，我媽——應該說……你親生母親，你應該去見見她……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……她還活著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰告訴你她死了！她活得好好的，就在維多利亞西邊的一個小鎮裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等這邊的事結束了，我就帶你回去見她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她……她一定很想見你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好……好好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你哭什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……我沒有……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你才是，你幹嘛也一副快要哭出來的表情……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是……高興。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我哪能想到，長這麼大了，我還能突然多一個妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡有這樣的姐妹……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說了，誰是妹妹還不一定呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我今天這麼難過，你就不能讓讓我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛剛還安慰我來著……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是想說……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從今往後，你就不是孤零零的一個人了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……真好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "世上百味，到底還是團圓的味道最好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是……丟死人了，我跟著哭什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後一樁心事，也算了啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，昨天晚上，在禁城中的那位大理寺的官員……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "驚蟄……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她送我出來的時候，被那個禁軍小姑娘截住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們現在該怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這件事，還沒結束……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要去，把原本該做的事做完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……你打算做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為所有人……討一個說法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一百年了。\n終於又回到了這裡——棋局開始的地方。\n棋盤結網蒙塵，天元上還留有一顆黑子。\n他伸手拂去了棋盤上的灰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上哪去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫人送飯去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你人走了，這店就不管了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都什麼點了，早打烊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明天還開嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……明天開不開，那得看明天的心情，說不準的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽你這意思，是要散夥了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行啊，你還欠我半年工錢，結了帳就放你走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呿……怎麼這麼小氣！為你做了那麼多頓員工餐，就抵不過這幾個月的債了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行行行……廚房灶台右手邊，從牆角往外數第三塊磚，下面藏著我的最後一點零用錢。你拿去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我跟了你不少年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，整整十五年。在跟過我的那些秉燭人裡，你算時間最久的，說明我們還是蠻有緣的嘛，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是我一直記得我還是司歲台的秉燭人，恐怕也跟不了你這麼久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，說實話，我也很多年沒記起來我到底是誰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒是沒故意記得或者不記得，人也好獸也罷，就覺得這樣活著，有滋有味，沒什麼不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你最好永遠不要記起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怕你想起來自己是誰，反而忘了人的口味。舌頭不好使了，這一手廚藝可就荒廢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……我也不想啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我總還記得，家裡還有這些個不讓人放心的哥哥姐姐，他們也是要吃飯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何況是最不讓人放心的那位……也不知道這麼久沒見，他到底怎麼樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道，今天去送了這一頓飯，是什麼後果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔……應該知道吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像灶火邊上不能屯棉花，多自然的道理，司歲台當然不樂意讓我們開家庭聚會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何況是這個節骨眼上……搞不好要是打起來，明天你可能就見不到我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……這些年，我做過許多飯，見了好多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想讓每一個走進這家店的客人，都能吃上好吃可口的飯，過的日子也都能圓滿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "灶上的酸甜苦辣，心中的喜怒哀樂，世上的悲歡離合，多像同一回事啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可鮮鱗多刺，海棠無香，世上多的還是遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "肚子餓了要吃飯，睏了要睡覺……想念親人了，也總是要去見見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……你就真的捨得……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還有很多捨不得的東西，可是再捨不得，也不能一直緊抓著不放手啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老姜……我不在的時候，這家小飯館能暫時拜託給你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看著我做了那麼久的飯，我會做的菜，你應該也會個七七八八了吧。將來再有客人來，你就替我招呼招呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餘",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“餘味居”……這名字取得倒是蠻好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餘",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這人間，餘味悠長啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g7_forbiddencity"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏的衛兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1637_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "報告校將，巡防營派出全部兵力，已經在八個城區進行了一輪地毯式的搜查，還是沒發現目標。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經過去一整天了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天亮之前，必須——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說你在找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼？現在是打算投案自首？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，也省得我到處找你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管你是因百珍宴上的事要抓我，還是因我的身分要抓我……現在都不是時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我現在有要緊事要做，我勸你最好讓開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還從來沒有這麼生氣過。你要是想攔我，大可試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
